WEBVTT

00:01.376 --> 00:04.493
In the not so distant future,
when the corporate networks

00:04.588 --> 00:07.751
fill the earth with electronic
and optical communication lines

00:07.841 --> 00:11.004
but society has not yet been
too computerized

00:11.094 --> 00:15.838
to erase nations and races...
